            }
          ],
          "orig": "Before you can wage war in a game of Warhammer 40,000, you must first select a mission. The Core Rules include a single mission - Only War - that is ideal to get the action started quickly. Others can be found elsewhere in this or other books, or you could play a mission of your own creation. If you and your opponent can't agree which mission to play, you must roll off, and the winner decides.",
          "text": "Before you can wage war in a game of Warhammer 40,000, you must first select a mission. The Core Rules include a single mission - Only War - that is ideal to get the action started quickly. Others can be found elsewhere in this or other books, or you could play a mission of your own creation. If you and your opponent can't agree which mission to play, you must roll off, and the winner decides."
        }
      ]
    },
